#. module: purchase_picking_batch_invoicing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_picking_batch_invoicing.field_purchase_picking_invoice_wizard__grouping
msgid ""
"Consolidate compatible receipts: creates a single vendor bill when company, "
"vendor, currency, fiscal position and payment terms match.\n"
"Receipts with different conditions are placed in separate vendor bills.\n"
"Create one bill per receipt: creates an independent vendor bill for each "
"selected receipt."
msgstr ""
"Consolidar albaranes compatibles: crea una sola factura cuando coinciden la "
"empresa, el proveedor, la moneda, la posición fiscal y los términos de "
"pago.\n"
"Los albaranes con condiciones diferentes se incluyen en facturas separadas.\n"
"Crear una factura por albarán: crea una factura independiente para cada "
"albarán seleccionado."

